<section class="mi9-app-header centerx"> 	  
	  <div class="description-box-info">
	   <h2>Wave - Audio Live Streaming Overview</h2> 
	      <div id="description-wrapper" class="description-wrapper">
        <div id="description-content" class="description-content" >	 
            <p>Wave - Audio Live Streaming provides a space for voice based social interaction, centered on live audio rooms. The app allows users to host or join streams without video, focusing on conversation, singing, or casual broadcasting. A group function supports streams with multiple participants.</p>

<p>Feedback suggests the audio quality is often clear, and the format appeals to those who enjoy informal, voice led socializing. However, some users report technical issues like audio playback failing or difficulty accessing local streams after updates. The interface language can also switch unexpectedly.</p>

<ul>
<li>Host audio only live streams with up to eight people.</li>
<li>Discover and connect with other users through voice based profiles.</li>
</ul>			        </div>
			
       <div id="fade-overlay" class="fade-overlay"></div>
		 </div>	
