<section class="apk-faq centerx" aria-labelledby="apk-faq-title">
    <div class="apk-faq__box">
        <div class="apk-faq__head">
            <h2 id="apk-faq-title">
                Wave - Audio Live Streaming FAQ
            </h2>
            <p>Common questions users often ask.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="apk-faq__list">
                                            <details class="apk-faq__item" open>
                    <summary class="apk-faq__question">
                        What is Wave Audio?                    </summary>
                    <div class="apk-faq__answer">
                        <p>Wave Audio is a social app for live streaming audio. You can broadcast your voice, music, or any audio content to your followers in real time. It&#039;s designed for easy and interactive audio streaming.</p>
                    </div>
                </details>
                                            <details class="apk-faq__item" >
                    <summary class="apk-faq__question">
                        How do I get sound on my live stream?                    </summary>
                    <div class="apk-faq__answer">
                        <p>Make sure your microphone is enabled and not muted in the app settings. Also check that your device&#039;s volume is turned up and that the app has permission to access your microphone.</p>
                    </div>
                </details>
                                            <details class="apk-faq__item" >
                    <summary class="apk-faq__question">
                        How can I live stream audio?                    </summary>
                    <div class="apk-faq__answer">
                        <p>Open the Wave app and tap the &#039;Go Live&#039; button. You can then choose to share your microphone or play audio from your device. Start streaming to your audience once you&#039;re ready.</p>
                    </div>
                </details>
                                            <details class="apk-faq__item" >
                    <summary class="apk-faq__question">
                        Why is there no sound on my live stream?                    </summary>
                    <div class="apk-faq__answer">
                        <p>This can happen if your microphone permissions are denied or if there&#039;s a connection issue. Restart the app, check your internet connection, and ensure your device isn&#039;t in silent mode.</p>
                    </div>
                </details>
                    </div>
    </div>
</section>
